@startuml
' Архитектура TASKFLOW CRM: модули и ядро
title TASKFLOW CRM: компоненты и слои

package "Внешние системы" {
    [Passport] as PASS <<SSO/OAuth2>>
}

package "Ядро (core)" {
    [Presentation\nконтроллеры, BaseController\nrequest, swagger] as C_PRES
    [Application\nCQRS, DTO, порты,\nNotificationHub] as C_APP
    [Domain\nRole, User, UserRole\nисключения, VO, события] as C_DOM
    [Infrastructure\nрепозитории (AR),\nGlobalEventDispatcher, JsonErrorHandler\nмиграции users/rbac] as C_INF
    [Security\nYiiIdentity] as C_SEC
}

package "Модули" {
    package "passport/auth" {
        [AuthController] as P_AUTH
        [PassportAuthMiddleware] as P_MW
        [PassportHttpClient] as P_HTTP
    }
    package "rbac" {
        [RbacMiddleware] as R_MW
        [AuthorizationService] as R_AUTH
    }
    package "projects" {
        [Project/Board/Invitation\nконтроллеры и хендлеры] as PRJ
        [ProjectAccess] as PRJ_ACC
        [Листенеры: owner, invitation,\npersonal project] as PRJ_L
    }
    package "tasks" {
        [Task/Column/Comment/Sticker\nконтроллеры и хендлеры] as TSK
        [TaskAccess] as TSK_ACC
        [AutoTimer/TimeTracking/\nPlannedInterval листенеры] as TSK_L
    }
    package "feedback" {
        [FeedbackController] as FB
        [SendNonMaxRatingEmailListener] as FB_L
    }
}

P_AUTH ..> C_SEC : YiiIdentity
P_MW ..> C_SEC
P_AUTH ..> C_APP : SyncUserHandler
P_HTTP --> PASS : HTTP

R_MW --> P_MW : после аутентификации
R_MW ..> C_SEC : identity
R_AUTH --> C_DOM : PermissionDeniedException

PRJ --> C_APP : UserFirstLoginEvent, NotificationHub
PRJ_ACC --> C_DOM : UserId и т.п.
PRJ_L --> C_APP

TSK --> PRJ : доски (IProjectAccess)
TSK_ACC --> PRJ_ACC : делегирование прав
TSK_L --> C_APP : GlobalEventDispatcher
TSK ..> C_APP : ITaskStatisticsService

FB --> C_APP : RatingSubmittedEvent, NotificationHub

C_PRES --> C_APP : вызывает хендлеры
C_APP --> C_DOM : сущности/VO
C_INF ..> C_APP : реализует порты
C_INF ..> C_DOM : реализует репозитории
C_SEC ..> C_PRES : используется

@enduml